tus/1798901584317108401\">Tweet by @lukeweston</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/lukeweston/status/1798901584317108401\">https://x.com/lukeweston/status/1798901584317108401</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1799146198848483671</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799146198848483671\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-06-07T18:27:34Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1799147432636547393":{"a":"<p>All entertainment technology is simple abused military technology. Turning news into entertainment was a brilliant move to confuse people into believing anything. <a href=\"https://x.com/Xenius/status/1798723779255804135\">Tweet by @Xenius</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Xenius/status/1798723779255804135\">https://x.com/Xenius/status/1798723779255804135</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1799147432636547393</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799147432636547393\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-06-07T18:32:29Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1799148235099087340":{"a":"<p>@WilliamHazen7 These things should be codified into city regulations. These get-rich-quick neighborhoods are designed without any of these amenities because they have no incentive to waste space they can&#x27;t sell on things people need to live their lives.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1799085347978227817\">https://x.com/i/status/1799085347978227817</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1799148235099087340</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799148235099087340\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-06-07T18:35:40Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1799148646245773312":{"a":"<p>@WilliamHazen7 When I was a child I walked to Frank&#x27;s grocery at age 4 to buy my own food and drink. It was in place of one house on our block. That would have been a house they couldn&#x27;t sell. It has since been replaced with a house. Because zoning.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1799148235099087340\">https://x.com/i/status/1799148235099087340</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1799148646245773312</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799148646245773312\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-06-07T18:37:18Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1799153338191126680":{"a":"<p>Noticing the drowsiness warning on GABApentin. Cannabis and alcohol simulate GABA. Lower your dose when combining them. Or better increase your Glutamine levels with food like mushrooms and MSG. Not a doctor, ymmv, no warranty on this advice.<br>\n #ThingsDoctorsCantSayDueToAMARules</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1799153338191126680</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799153338191126680\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-06-07T18:55:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1799153894225793095":{"a":"<p>GABA becomes toxic at too high doses. You don&#x27;t want to combine things that simulate GABA with GABA unless you really know what you&#x27;re doing. Smaller doses more often are better to give it time to clear out of your liver, etc.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1799153338191126680\">https://x.com/i/status/1799153338191126680</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 17991538942257